[0,"What is Domain-Driven Design?","blob/website/src/content/docs/domain/what-is-ddd.mdx","domain/what-is-ddd  The domain and its model A shared language Commands: what someone wants to happen Events: what happened Aggregates: where decisions are made Event sourcing: the events are the record CQRS: deciding and answering are separate Views: models for reading Queries: questions across many records Policies: the business's standing rules Testing: given, when, then Bounded contexts: one language per model How @alchemy.run/domain models these concepts"]
